  "benefits": "\n- **Insurance Coverage:** ₹5,00,000/- per eligible farmer- **Coverage Type:** Natural and accidental deaths- **Claim Settlement Mode:** Direct bank transfer to the nominee’s account- **Claim Process:** Entirely online, farmer families are not required to visit any office\n",
